{"reviewId": "57795120_889HeqLc6", "review": {"abstract": "直到2025年，可能都是第五次康波的萧条阶段", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterUid": 23, "content": "现在回过头来看，周金涛先生的周期理论基本上是与当前经济发展相符的。房地产因为2015年9月底，政府为了刺激经济发展而出台了相关利好政策，延续了房地产的衰退期，但是自2021年以后，房地产的衰退以一种崩盘的形式回应了之前的续命政策，不得不说经济周期的不可逆，你想通过刺激来拯救，它就会以更激烈的方式来摧毁。当前的这种崩溃式下跌，对我国的经济造成了沉重的打击，从而加速了经济萧条的进程，使得萧条期仍然按照周先生的预测，在2025年基本结束。自2026年开始将进入回升期。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "3731-3753", "createTime": 1775444571, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "57795120_889HeqLc6", "userVid": 57795120, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 57795120, "name": "1", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/CpK8F54ibkpJZNzDKEQQ20j9rIlt86KBp3rjzbrKXKricc0myvjSTSEbymh2CZMlvaX26ECMPffEh52cTUB6pfjQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-500", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 500}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 5, "likes": [{"userVid": 45116196, "name": "Hyuhui", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/bofA1vl6EUZzrQRcLDSfHlzZZ9dcYEXaeaJAqSZzLowmrRto6lgsHw/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-100", "desc": "想法发布